dencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducable in: 4.6-stable\n- Not reproducable in: 4.5.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThis appears to be a breaking change with v4.6. In v4.5 `ClassDB::get_class_list` returned the class list in alphabetical order. With 4.6 it is not anymore.\n\nIt seems the regression was introcuded with #108577.\nIn particular `SortArray<StringName> sorter;` should be `SortArray<StringName, StringName::AlphCompare> sorter;` in `ClassDB::get_class_list` and `ClassDB::get_extensions_class_list`.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Create a new script with the following code:\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint(\"- ClassDB.GetClassList -\")\n\tprint(\"\\n\".join(ClassDB.get_class_list()))\n```\n3. Run the project\n\nExpected behavior: Class list is in alphabetical order (as is in 4.5.1)\n<img width=\"390\" height=\"376\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a42c7ba9-cd22-421a-ae1d-36e215418f9b\" />\n\nActual behavior: Class list is in semi-random order (probably by pointer/address).\n<img width=\"313\" height=\"277\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11f3fce2-ce0b-4aee-b655-9336deaa9fcd\" />\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[class-db-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25103526/class-db-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/